    "name": "Automations File Service Files API",
    "description": "# Introduction\n\nThe Automations File Service API exposes a secured and isolated file store for you to manage files intended for a Qualtrics Automation.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Contact Qualtrics Support for more information.",
